{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46897","headline":"渚宫春日因怀有作 · 齐己","name":"渚宫春日因怀有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧业树连湘树远，家山云与岳云平。\n僧来已说无耕钓，鴈去那知有弟兄。\n客思莫牵蝴蝶梦，乡心自忆鹧鸪声。\n沙头南望堪肠断，谁把归舟载我行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}